# Lucky Lou Laffer, the Pier's boss (worlds/01_PIER.md, "The boss"; levels/pier/keys/laffer.gd). He never stops
# laughing, even when it isn't funny. Every joke is the owner's to review.

~ intro
Laffer [laugh]: Ha ha ha! Roll up, roll up! Welcome to the Prize Hall, where everybody's a winner!
Laffer: And what's this? The Rope's little climber, with my ledger. Ha ha. That's not funny. Ha ha ha!
Nim: It's very funny. You're going to prison.
Laffer: Step right up! We'll play Lucky Dip. You're the prize! Ha ha ha ha!

~ chute
Laffer [laugh]: Ha! Rigged! It's all rigged! Everything in here's rigged, sweetheart!
Laffer: Whack-a-goon, boys! Ha ha ha!

~ toy
[narrator] Laffer scrambles up the prize mountain and holds out a boxed plushie. Its spiral glows.
Laffer [laugh]: Look into the spiral... deep, deep into the spiral... you're feeling very... very...
Laffer: ...Huh.
Laffer: It works on everyone. It works on EVERYONE. Ha... ha?
Nim: Not on me. Not anymore.
Laffer: Ha ha! Right! Throw the prizes at her! Everybody's a winner!

~ rosette
[narrator] Lucky Lou Laffer, tied up tight at the top of his own prize mountain, with a WINNER rosette pinned to his chest.
Laffer [laugh]: Ha! Ha ha! Look at me! The grand prize!
Nim: The police will be along to collect it.
Laffer: Ha ha ha ha! ...Ha. Ha ha. Somebody stop me laughing. Ha ha ha!
